        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/93594?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Summary</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><code class=\"notranslate\">position-area</code> in Chrome has a fundamental bug where the content of the element overflows the viewport, obscuring content. It's important to work around this.</p>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Test results and supporting details</h4>\n\n\n<p dir=\"auto\"><a href=\"https://issues.chromium.org/issues/438334710\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://issues.chromium.org/issues/438334710</a></p>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/27573",
            "title": "Chrome allows overflows with some `position-area` values",
            "date_modified": "2025-08-14T08:37:47.000Z",
            "date_published": "2025-08-13T09:29:55.000Z",
            "author": {
                "name": "jakearchibald",
                "url": "https://github.com/jakearchibald"
            }
        },
        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/286386?u=bc4894b945491e0834d2306dade7fef748ddf698&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h4 dir=\"auto\">Summary</h4>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Added FF support for <code class=\"notranslate\">match-element</code> value of <code class=\"notranslate\">view-transition-name</code> property</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Test results and supporting details</h4>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Tested, <a href=\"https://mdn.github.io/dom-examples/view-transitions/match-element/\" rel=\"nofollow\">with this demo</a>, in the following Firefox Browsers with the flag <code class=\"notranslate\">dom.viewTransitions.enabled</code>:\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>Nightly 143.0a1 no flag needed</li>\n<li>Developer Edition 142.0b7</li>\n<li>Beta 142.0b7</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 dir=\"auto\">Related issues</h4>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/40479\" data-hovercard-type=\"issue\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/issues/40479/hovercard\">MDN issue #40479</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/40708\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/pull/40708/hovercard\">Content PR</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/40707\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/pull/40707/hovercard\">Firefox release PR</a></li>\n</ul>",
            "url": "https://github.com/mdn/browser-compat-data/pull/27566",
            "title": "Added FF support for `match-element` value of `view-transition-name` property",
            "date_modified": "2025-08-12T16:35:48.000Z",
